%% Figure: Order lifecycle (checkout.orders.status).
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: order created with an ACTIVE hold
    PENDING --> PAID: worker captures mock payment
    PENDING --> FAILED: declined token or hold expired
    PENDING --> CANCELLED: customer cancels before paying
    PAID --> CANCELLED: organiser cancels event (refund, paid_at kept)
    PAID --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
